{"id":"scheinbar","lemma":"scheinbar","pos":"adv","rank":2142,"glosses":["apparently (seemingly)"],"ipa":"/ˈʃaɪ̯nbaːɐ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/86/De-scheinbar.ogg/De-scheinbar.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Scheinbar weiß er alles.","en":"It seems that he knows everything.","words":[null,{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"everything"}]},{"text":"Scheinbar kennt er das Geheimnis.","en":"It seems like he knows the secret.","words":[null,{"g":"to know","l":"kennen"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"secret"}]},{"text":"Scheinbar Unmögliches geschieht bisweilen.","en":"Seemingly impossible things sometimes happen.","words":[null,{"g":"impossibly","l":"unmöglich"},{"g":"to occur","l":"geschehen"},{"g":"sometimes"}]},{"text":"Tom wusste scheinbar nicht, was er sagen soll.","en":"Tom didn't seem to know what to say.","words":[null,{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"}]},{"text":"Bisweilen geschieht das scheinbar Unmögliche.","en":"Seemingly impossible things sometimes happen.","words":[{"g":"sometimes"},{"g":"to occur","l":"geschehen"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"impossibly","l":"unmöglich"}]}]}